        <mxCell id="note" value="Spec col. 6: PID controller 100 regulates the voltage across resistors 96 to fine-tune each carrier package temperature (range on the order of 1 degree); glass pads 92 on mounting edges 94 thermally isolate the package from the heat-sink. Also usable to tune filter centre frequency. Filter loop per US5818097." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
